Replace this file with the real BOG public key and save it as keys/bog_public.pem
(or paste the PEM into the BOG_PUBLIC_KEY env var).

Get the current key from BOG's official docs:
  https://api.bog.ge/docs/en/payments/standard-process/callback

It looks like this (the example below is a PLACEHOLDER — do NOT use it):

-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEAu4RUyAw3+CdkS3ZNILQh
... copy the full key from the BOG documentation page ...
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
